    {
      "id": "c1",
      "title": "第一章 · 蓝底白花",
      "subtitle": "序之后的过场（c1_open 起）",
      "shots": [
        {"id":"01","file":"Texture_C1Open01_ColdStove.jpg","beat":"c1_open","dur":"4.0s","cam":"insert","picture":"灶是冷的。柱子蹲在灶前，摸了一把锅底——干的。","line":""},
        {"id":"02","file":"Texture_C1Open02_GrainUrn.jpg","beat":"c1_open","dur":"3.8s","cam":"insert","picture":"他掀开粮瓮。瓮底只剩薄薄一层糜子。","line":""},
        {"id":"03","file":"Texture_C1Open07_WaterVat.jpg","beat":"c1_open","dur":"5.6s","cam":"insert","picture":"水缸见了底。瓢探下去刮着缸底，提上来小半瓢。","line":""},
        {"id":"04","file":"Texture_C1Open03_CollapsedShed.jpg","beat":"c1_open","dur":"5.6s","cam":"shot","picture":"牲口棚塌了半边。橛子还在，缰绳没有断口——是解走的。","line":""},
        {"id":"05","file":"Texture_C1Open04_EmptyCoop.jpg","beat":"c1_open","dur":"3.0s","cam":"insert","picture":"鸡笼倒在墙边。里面是空的。","line":""},
        {"id":"06","file":"Texture_C1Open05_ShortSleeve.jpg","beat":"c1_open","dur":"3.8s","cam":"insert","picture":"妹妹蜷在炕上。去年的褂子短了一截，袖口遮不住手腕。","line":""},
        {"id":"07","file":"Texture_C1Open06_ThirdDay.jpg","beat":"c1_open","dur":"3.2s","cam":"insert","picture":"第三天。还是没人来叫。","line":"旁白：「第三天。还是没人来叫。」"},
        {"id":"08","file":"Texture_C1Count01_ThreeMarks.jpg","beat":"c1_count","dur":"3.0+4.1s","cam":"insert","picture":"妹妹吹掉石粉，一道一道点门框上的正字。","line":"妹妹：「一。」「二。」「三。」"},
        {"id":"09","file":"Texture_C1Count02_WhenReturn.jpg","beat":"c1_count","dur":"2.8+2.4s","cam":"insert → close","picture":"她回头看柱子。柱子没有回答。只剩风吹窗纸。","line":"妹妹：「他们啥时候回来？」"},
        {"id":"10","file":"Texture_C1Uncle01_AfterBell.jpg","beat":"c1_uncle","dur":"3.4+5.4s","cam":"shot","picture":"链条声远去。水还在。七叔扶墙站起来——他也蹲着的。","line":""},
        {"id":"11","file":"Texture_C1Uncle02_BlackBeans.jpg","beat":"c1_uncle","dur":"4.8+3.2s","cam":"shot → insert","picture":"七叔往柱子怀里塞一把黑豆。柱子往回推，七叔按住他的手。","line":"七叔：「晚上过来吃。」"},
        {"id":"12","file":"Texture_C1Uncle03_ISaidSo.jpg","beat":"c1_uncle","dur":"2.2+1.4+2.2s","cam":"insert","picture":"七叔再次按住他的手，把那笔债说成是真的。","line":"七叔：「我说有。」「就有。」"},
        {"id":"13","file":"Texture_C1Knows01_SisterWaiting.jpg","beat":"c1_knows","dur":"3.6+3.2s","cam":"shot → insert","picture":"柱子爬出菜窖，没有盖翻板。三步外站着赤脚的妹妹。","line":"妹妹：「我当你也走了。」"},
        {"id":"14","file":"Texture_C1Mend01_DawnWounded.jpg","beat":"c1_mend","dur":"4.6+4.2s","cam":"shot → insert","picture":"板缝里的光从黑变成青灰。伤员肩上仍扎着蓝花布。","line":""},
        {"id":"15","file":"Texture_C1Mend02_LadderSew.jpg","beat":"c1_mend","dur":"3.6s","cam":"shot","picture":"柱子坐在最上一级梯子上，拿着妹妹的旧褂和针线。","line":""},
        {"id":"16","file":"Texture_C1Home01_BlueCuff.jpg","beat":"c1_home","dur":"3.8+2.2s","cam":"insert","picture":"蓝花袖口滑下来，盖住她的手腕。妹妹睁开眼。","line":"妹妹：「哥？」"},
        {"id":"17","file":"Texture_C1End02_DoorGap.jpg","beat":"c1_end","dur":"4.4+4.2s","cam":"shot","picture":"从没有关严的屋门，看见柱子走到菜窖旁，翻板只留半尺缝。","line":""},
        {"id":"18","file":"Texture_C1End01_TwoLevels.jpg","beat":"c1_end","dur":"3.4+3.6+4.4s","cam":"insert 剖面","picture":"地上妹妹的手腕、地下伤员肩上，同一块蓝花布。门和翻板都留着缝。","line":"章名卡：「第一章结束」"}
      ]
    },
    {
