        {"id":"02","file":"Texture_C5Alarm01_Again.jpg","beat":"c5_alarm","dur":"3.8s","cam":"shot 剖面","picture":"没过几天，又来了。还是老一套：堵口，灌烟。","line":""},
        {"id":"03","file":"Texture_C5Test01_SmokeBend.jpg","beat":"c5_test","dur":"4.0+4.2s","cam":"shot","picture":"烟堵在弯里一夜没退。地面上什么也看不出来。一个年轻民兵被土石压住了腿。","line":""},
